title: Faust0Start
---
<<declare $playerName = "player">>
<<gatherVars>>
<<freezePlayer>>
You pass by a door but stop at loud shouts from inside.
You peer in and see a crowd cheering around a fight.

A roar erupts as a man raises his fist in victory.
He basks in the admiration, and you stare.

The next match begins. You spot him again,
still in wrestling gear, a towel over his shoulders.

He notices you and turns, eyes lighting up.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Hello! Are you a member here?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He looks at your outfit, clearly confused.

-> Say You're a Fan
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump AFan>>
-> Tell The Truth
    <<jump TellTruth>>
-> Lie
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump LieNode>>
===

title: AFan
---
You decide quickly.

You: "I'm sorry. I'm a big fan of you.
You did amazing today."

He grins instantly, eyes lighting up.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Really? That means a lot, thank you!"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

<<jump MyNameIs>>
===

title: TellTruth
---
You: "I need your help with something."

His posture relaxes, energy dropping.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Oh? You need my help? Why?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He seems slightly disappointed.

<<jump MyNameIs>>
===

title: LieNode
---
You: "Oh yeah, I'm in the club too."

The lie slips out. You stand awkwardly.

He studies you carefully.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Yeah...I don't believe you. Why are you here?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You sigh. That was a bad idea.

<<jump MyNameIs>>
===

title: MyNameIs
---
You: "Hi, I'm {$playerName}. I need volunteers
for my philosophy essay."

You: "Would you be interested?"

He perks up instantly.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Of course! I'd love to help. I'm Faust."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

Before you reply, voices grow louder.

A group of girls push through, looking for him.

He brightens, almost forgetting you.

-> Let him go
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump LetHimGo>>
-> Tug his shirt
    <<jump TugHisShirt>>
-> Say excuse me
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump SayExcuseMe>>
===

title: LetHimGo
---
You watch him walk away, hesitant to stop him.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "The match was tough! Thanks for asking!"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

The girls giggle, crowding him.

After a while, they leave. He notices you.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Oh...sorry about that."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You: "It's fine..."

You both move somewhere quieter.

<<jump SoDoYou>>
===

title: TugHisShirt
---
You panic and grab his shirt.

You: "Wait! We still need to talk!"

He startles, then forces a smile.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Oh! Apologies, let's go."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

He reluctantly follows you away.

<<jump SoDoYou>>
===

title: SayExcuseMe
---
You frown as he walks off.

You: "Uh...excuse me?"

He turns, excitement fading.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Ah...sorry. I got carried away."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You both step aside to talk.

<<jump SoDoYou>>
===

title: SoDoYou
---
You: "So, you'll answer questions weekly?"

He nods.

You: "Actually two a week for more detail."

He looks at the paper, then laughs.

You frown, confused.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Sorry...but aren't these kinda cringe?"
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

-> Explain your questions
    <<incRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump ExplainQs>>
-> Ask what's wrong
    <<jump AskWhat>>
-> Defend your questions
    <<decRelationship "Faust" 1>>
    <<jump Defend>>
===

title: ExplainQs
---
You: "It's a classic dilemma. Sacrifice one
to save many."

You: "It shows what people value."

He thinks it over.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Ahh...I see. That makes sense."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>
===

title: AskWhat
---
You: "What's wrong with them?"

He looks away briefly.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Nothing. They're fine."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

That doesn't convince you.
===

title: Defend
---
You: "Cringe?"

You narrow your eyes.

You: "I'm the philosophy student here."

He raises his hands.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>
Faust: "Woah, okay. My bad."
<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>

You decide to drop it.

<<allowPlayerToMove>>
<<loadScene "CampusGrounds">>
===